{{!
    @template local_awareness/editor/layout_option

    The label of one layout radio in the notice editor: a schematic thumbnail drawn by the
    stylesheet from the layout's own class, and the layout's name. Rendered into the radio's
    label by notice_form, which is why there is no input here.

    Context variables required for this template:
      * template - the layout key, one of awareness::TEMPLATES, used as a class suffix
      * name - the layout's name, already a translated string

    Example context (json):
    {
        "template": "hero",
        "name": "Hero image"
    }
}}
<span class="la-layout-option la-layout-option--{{template}}">
    <span class="la-layout-thumb" aria-hidden="true"><span class="la-layout-thumb-box"></span></span>
    <span class="la-layout-name">{{name}}</span>
</span>
